      "writtenOn": "2024-09-10T19:26:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agree Doug, we need to upstream (in this case to AOSP) anything we need permanently if possible, otherwise the next branch cut the diff will widen even further.\n\nWe set up a branch of `android-mainline`, `android-mainline-desktop` in case it\u0027s deemed not suitable.",
      "parentUuid": "2d75e1db_15d93b39",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 7,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 7,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "cf82322e1f25b53701e3ce9320bd7bb3831020be",
